{"id":"steam-986211","steam":986211,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Chicken Shoot Digital Deluxe Content","summary":"This Chicken Shoot Digital Deluxe Content gives players a fun and artistic insight into the unrivaled world of poultry.","about":"This Chicken Shoot Digital Deluxe Content gives players a fun and artistic insight into the unrivaled world of poultry.\r\n\r\n! ! ! Warning spoiler alert ! ! !\r\n\r\nThe Chicken Shoot Artbook combines artistic impressions of the individual levels with numerous sketches and poses of individual chickens and their creation process and offers you the unique opportunity to immerse yourself in a world full of breathtaking details. The Chicken Gallery takes you on an entertaining short trip into the lovingly designed world of \"Chicken Shoot\"!\r\n\r\nIn addition to the 40-pages artbook, this digital deluxe content contains 6 wallpapers in full HD and 4K resolutions and a guide 'How to reach the bonus level'. \r\n\r\nDigital Deluxe Content:\r\n \n\n• \n40 pages Artbook (PDF Format)\n• \n6 Wallpaper in Full-HD and 4K resolutions\n• \nmore than 30 GIF chicken animations\n• \nGuide \"How to reach the Bonus Level\"","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/3cd71b68bc2700bf9f440593746bc48902566d30/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1789973434","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/header.jpg?t=1789973434","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/header.jpg?t=1789973434","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/ss_844f97c6221f3d7f6c7565a903637e6ef95bcded.600x338.jpg?t=1789973434","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/ss_844f97c6221f3d7f6c7565a903637e6ef95bcded.jpg?t=1789973434"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986211/ss_4b8d62c787db40